    'Casual, usually to yourself. Don\'t use it about someone else\'s mistake to their face; it can sound dismissive.',
  ),
  'いいね': VocabUsage(
    'こんど うみ に いこう よ。 いいね！',
    'kondo umi ni ikou yo. ii ne!',
    'Lain kali ke pantai yuk. Bagus tuh!',
