    'Netral. Pola: watch out for + bahaya. Sering perintah: Watch out! Mirip look out.',
    'Neutral. Pattern: watch out for + danger. Often an order: Watch out! Similar to look out.',
  ),
  'piece of cake': VocabUsage(
    'The exam was a piece of cake — I finished in twenty minutes.',
