    'Ujiannya gampang banget — aku selesai dalam dua puluh menit.',
    '',
    'Santai. Biasanya \'It\'s/That was a piece of cake\'. Jangan diartikan harfiah \'sepotong kue\'.',
    'Casual. Usually \'It\'s/That was a piece of cake\'. Not about actual cake.',
  ),
  'easier said than done': VocabUsage(
    'Saving half your salary is easier said than done.',
    '',
    'Menabung setengah gaji itu gampang diomongin, susah dijalanin.',
    '',
    'Netral. Biasanya sebagai tanggapan: \'That\'s easier said than done.\'',
    'Neutral. Often a reply: \'That\'s easier said than done.\'',
  ),
  'a walk in the park': VocabUsage(
    'After years of night shifts, this office job is a walk in the park.',
