    'Setelah bertahun-tahun kerja sif malam, kerja kantoran ini enteng banget.',
    '',
    'Santai. Pola: be a walk in the park; sering dengan \'not\': It\'s no walk in the park. Bukan soal jalan-jalan di taman.',
    'Casual. Pattern: be a walk in the park; often negative: It\'s no walk in the park. Not about parks.',
  ),
  'not rocket science': VocabUsage(
    'Changing a tire is not rocket science — I\'ll show you.',
    '',
    'Ganti ban itu nggak sesulit yang kamu kira — sini aku ajarin.',
    '',
    'Santai. Pola: It\'s not rocket science. Dipakai untuk meyakinkan bahwa sesuatu sebenarnya sederhana.',
    'Casual. Pattern: It\'s not rocket science. Used to reassure that something is simple.',
  ),
  'get the hang of it': VocabUsage(
    'Driving a manual car is tricky at first, but you\'ll get the hang of it.',
    '',
    'Nyetir mobil manual memang susah di awal, tapi nanti kamu terbiasa juga.',
    '',
    'Santai. Pola: get the hang of it / get the hang of + benda/V-ing.',
    'Casual. Pattern: get the hang of it / get the hang of + noun/V-ing.',
  ),
  'smooth sailing': VocabUsage(
    'Once we fixed the bug, it was smooth sailing until launch.',
    '',
    'Setelah bug-nya diperbaiki, semuanya lancar sampai peluncuran.',
    '',
    'Netral. Pola: It\'s smooth sailing (from here). Versi Inggris British: plain sailing.',
    'Neutral. Pattern: It\'s smooth sailing (from here). British version: plain sailing.',
  ),
  'a tough nut to crack': VocabUsage(
