    'Kami harus melewati prosedur yang ribet banget cuma untuk dapat visa.',
    '',
    'Santai. Pola: have to jump through hoops (to + V). Biasanya mengeluhkan birokrasi.',
    'Casual. Pattern: have to jump through hoops (to + verb). Usually complaining about bureaucracy.',
  ),
  'bite off more than you can chew': VocabUsage(
    'Don\'t bite off more than you can chew — three courses at once is too much.',
