    'Jangan memaksakan diri — ambil tiga kursus sekaligus itu terlalu banyak.',
    '',
    'Santai. Biasanya dalam bentuk lampau: I bit off more than I could chew.',
    'Casual. Often in the past: I bit off more than I could chew.',
  ),
  'learn the hard way': VocabUsage(
    'I learned the hard way that you should always back up your files.',
