    'Aku belajar dari pengalaman pahit bahwa file harus selalu di-backup.',
    '',
    'Netral. Pola: learn (something) the hard way / learn the hard way that + klausa.',
    'Neutral. Pattern: learn (something) the hard way / learn the hard way that + clause.',
  ),
  'once in a blue moon': VocabUsage(
    'My brother lives abroad, so I only see him once in a blue moon.',
