    'Kakakku tinggal di luar negeri, jadi aku jarang sekali ketemu dia.',
    '',
    'Santai. Biasanya di akhir kalimat. Bukan soal bulan biru sungguhan.',
    'Casual. Usually at the end of a sentence. Not about a real blue moon.',
  ),
  'in the nick of time': VocabUsage(
    'We got to the gate in the nick of time — they were closing the doors.',
    '',
    'Kami sampai di gerbang tepat sebelum terlambat — pintunya sudah mau ditutup.',
    '',
    'Netral. Menekankan nyaris terlambat. Mirip \'just in time\'.',
    'Neutral. Stresses almost being too late. Similar to \'just in time\'.',
  ),
  'at the eleventh hour': VocabUsage(
    'The deal was saved at the eleventh hour.',
    '',
    'Kesepakatan itu terselamatkan di saat-saat terakhir.',
    '',
    'Netral, sering di berita. Bentuk sifat: an eleventh-hour decision. Bukan jam sebelas.',
    'Neutral, common in news. Adjective form: an eleventh-hour decision. Not 11 o\'clock.',
  ),
  'in no time': VocabUsage(
    'Don\'t worry, we\'ll be there in no time.',
