    'Santai. Bisa juga \'in no time at all\'. Artinya sangat cepat, bukan \'tidak ada waktu\'.',
    'Casual. Also \'in no time at all\'. Means very quickly, not \'no time available\'.',
  ),
  'on the dot': VocabUsage(
    'The meeting starts at nine on the dot, so don\'t be late.',
    '',
    'Rapatnya mulai jam sembilan tepat, jadi jangan telat.',
    '',
    'Netral. Diletakkan setelah jam: at 9 o\'clock on the dot.',
    'Neutral. Goes after the time: at 9 o\'clock on the dot.',
  ),
  'around the clock': VocabUsage(
    'Nurses here work around the clock in three shifts.',
    '',
    'Perawat di sini bekerja siang malam dalam tiga sif.',
    '',
    'Netral. Pola: work/run around the clock. Bentuk sifat: round-the-clock care.',
    'Neutral. Pattern: work/run around the clock. Adjective: round-the-clock care.',
  ),
  'kill time': VocabUsage(
    'I killed time at the airport by reading a magazine.',
    '',
    'Aku mengisi waktu di bandara dengan baca majalah.',
    '',
    'Santai. Pola: kill time (by + V-ing). Tidak ada unsur kekerasan.',
    'Casual. Pattern: kill time (by + V-ing). Nothing violent about it.',
  ),
  'miss the boat': VocabUsage(
    'Tickets sold out in an hour — if you didn\'t buy early, you missed the boat.',
